>>>Today's Funny

Upon retiring, a woman decides to get a physical. The doctor asked her how she was doing, so with a sigh, she reported a litany of symptoms - this aches, that's stiff, I'm not as quick as I used to be, and so on. 

He responded with, "You have to expect things to start deteriorating. After all, who wants to live to be a hundred?" 

She looked him straight in the eye and replied, "Anyone who's ninety-nine."

[forwarded by Steve Sanderson]

